		</a>

		<a href="/nexus" class="group relative flex items-center justify-center w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 hover:border-indigo-400 text-slate-400 hover:text-indigo-400 transition-all hover:scale-105">
